<view class="page">
  <view class="card hero">
    <view class="hero-num">{{total}}</view>
    <view class="hero-label">总词汇量</view>
    <view class="hero-status" wx:if="{{!synced}}">{{hasLocal ? '云端同步中…' : '正在从云端加载…'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">掌握情况</view>
  <view class="card-list">
    <view class="card level-card" wx:for="{{levels}}" wx:key="id" hover-class="card-hover"
          data-level="{{item.id}}" bindtap="goList">
      <view class="level-row">
        <text class="level-name" style="color: {{item.color}}">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="level-count">{{counts[index]}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="bar">
        <view class="bar-fill" style="width: {{percents[index]}}%; background: {{item.color}}"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="level-pct">{{percents[index]}}%</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card empty-card" wx:if="{{synced && total === 0}}">
    还没有记录。点下面的「记单词」一个个加，或用「批量导入」把笔记本上的存量单词一次贴进来。
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goAdd">记单词</view>
    <view class="btn btn-plain" bindtap="goImport">批量导入</view>
  </view>
</view>
